  "title": "Week 35: 🐐 Goat Counter",
  "date": "2025-08-19T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 35: 🐐 Goat Counter\n\nNever thought this would happen — I was at the gym 🏋️‍♂️ when I got a notification: my Cloudflare quota was maxed out… all because of the little PV counter I built earlier. 😅\n\nGoat Counter\n\nAfter a bit of thinking 🤔, I figured it’s smarter to use a SaaS instead of reinventing the wheel. That’s when I stumbled upon Goat Counter 🐐✨.\n\nIt offers:\n\n📊 A clean, simple dashboard\n\n📡 A beacon API (no cookies needed!)\n\n🔌 APIs to display PVs directly on my site\n\nAnd the best part? It’s unlimited & free, with the option to self-host if you want. 🚀\n\nReact Bits\n\nThis week, I also rewrote some blog card logic to make the build faster ⚡. Added some sleek UI components from React Bits and finally finished the archive page. 🎉\n\nMicrosoft Clipchamp\n\nI used to rely on CapCut for video editing. Lately, they started charging for many features 💸, so I switched to Microsoft Clipchamp. After a few rebuilds, I must say — it’s solid and totally enough for my needs. 🎬✨",
